Flask-Migrate (Alembic) migration environment.

  flask db upgrade                 # apply all pending migrations
  flask db revision -m "message"   # hand-written revision
  flask db migrate  -m "message"   # autogenerate from model changes (review before applying)

Revision 0001 creates the full baseline schema. Revision 0002 seeds the four
fixed roles and the 302 question catalogue. Both are idempotent on a clean
database; never edit an applied revision -- add a new one.
